; ---- BARE fallback aliases (no mag-state suffix) ----
; The engine GATES several features on isHUDAnimationExist(<bare name>): the scope-anim branch on
; anm_idle_aim_scope / anm_idle_aim_scope_moving (WeaponMagazined.cpp:2462-2477) and the whole ADS
; shoot branch on anm_shoot_aim (SelectShootAnim). This weapon only declares the _0/_1/_2 mag-state
; variants, so those gates never passed and the scope anims silently fell back to the iron sights.
; A bare alias makes the gate resolve; PlayHUDMotion still prefers the state-suffixed variant.
